Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/icefoxj/CrealityHiMonitor
Description: HM-01 live print monitor for a Creality Hi
 Shows the job running on a Creality Hi on the same network: percent done,
 finish time, time left, layer, temperatures, speed, flow, fans, filament and
 the file, on a mech-style dashboard. It reads the printer's own websocket
 (port 9999), finds the printer on the network by itself and alerts when the
 job ends. An app for the CardputerZero launcher; ESC returns to the menu.
